# Vendored semgrep rules (gh#320): reproduced from the pinned image by
# `just vendor-semgrep`, hashed by `just check-vendored`, read by
# `just scan-semgrep`. Git-ignored because the tree carries semgrep test
# fixtures that are not JSON, which the pre-commit duplicate-key guard
# refuses to commit. Never hand-edit; re-vendor instead.
gate-semgrep-rules/

